<p>Your halves learn new talents.</p><p>Crystaline Half: Rain of Spikes - A massive effect that makes all nearby foes bleed.</p><p>Stone Half: Stone Link - A protective shield that will redirect all damage against nearby allies to your Stone Half.</p><p>The level of those talents is <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5.</acronym></p>